{"id":"prepositions-0002","taskId":"prepositions","title":"Drill set 2","text":null,"source":"drill","gaps":[{"answer":"from","accept":[],"options":["of","from","by","with"],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"She suffered ___ migraines for years before the surgery.","hint":"suffer ___ an illness","explanation":"\u0027Suffer from\u0027 an illness or condition."},{"answer":"of","accept":[],"options":["about","to","of","with"],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"This perfume always reminds me ___ my grandmother.","hint":"remind somebody ___ something","explanation":"\u0027Remind somebody of something\u0027 = make them think of it."},{"answer":"on","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"You should concentrate ___ one task at a time.","hint":"concentrate ___ sth","explanation":"concentrate ON something."},{"answer":"to","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Be kind ___ your little brother.","hint":"kind ___ sb","explanation":"kind TO somebody."},{"answer":"from","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"The results differ sharply ___ last year\u0027s.","hint":"differ ___ sth","explanation":"differ FROM something (one thing differs from another); differ WITH = disagree."},{"answer":"to","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"I much prefer coffee ___ tea.","hint":"prefer A ___ B","explanation":"prefer A TO B (never \u0027than\u0027)."},{"answer":"for","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"I\u0027m looking ___ my keys \u2014 have you seen them?","hint":"look ___ = search","explanation":"look FOR = try to find."},{"answer":"on","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"The government imposed new restrictions ___ water use.","hint":"restrictions ___ sth","explanation":"restrictions ON something."}]}